OL,3,GNEWSAPrison attack on Sara Sharif's
OL,4,Afather was 'with tin lid'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo prisoners have appeared in court
OL,7,Faccused of attempting to murder Urfan
OL,8,FSharif, who was jailed for killing his
OL,9,F10-year-old daughter, Sara Sharif.
OL,11,FSteven Sansom, 47, and Adam Watson, 39,
OL,12,Fwere charged earlier this month
OL,13,Ffollowing an incident in Belmarsh
OL,14,FPrison on 1 January 2025, which left
OL,15,FSharif with injuries to his face, mouth
OL,16,Fand neck.
OL,18,FThe weapon alleged to have been used in
OL,19,Fthe assault was a bent tin lid,
OL,20,Faccording to the charge sheet.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
